    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1023090/extras/96a5cf11a9871ccedf52a5748cafbc70.poster.avif?t=1719118853\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1023090/extras/96a5cf11a9871ccedf52a5748cafbc70.webm?t=1719118853\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1023090/extras/96a5cf11a9871ccedf52a5748cafbc70.mp4?t=1719118853\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>Super Agent: Drunk Kent</strong> is a take on the classic platformer elements of old, with a physics based twist. Our hero (the greatest Agent on the side of good) does his best work.....plastered! Enamored by the intoxication of alcohol! Sloshed! However, in this state he can; Jump, dodge, hone his reflexes and slow time, and survive all the devious traps one could find being a Secret Agent! <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1023090/extras/2de71b84b1bf064bbe78c6e173ad1d3c.webp?t=1719118853\" /></div><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Physics based Platforming..</li></ul><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Drunken Slo-mo.. </li></ul><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Over twenty custom made music tracks..</li></ul><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Classic platforming elements..</li></ul><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Physics puzzles..</li></ul><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Cunning retro A.I..</li></ul><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Totally physics based movement..</li></ul><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Distinct worlds to explore and survive..</li></ul><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Full Controller Support.. </li></ul><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Hand Drawn Pixel Art..</li></ul><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Environment Based Traps..</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=